<title>FRANCE: Bouygues sees positive EPS in unit merger.</title>
<headline>Bouygues sees positive EPS in unit merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French construction group Bouygues said on Thursday the results of the planned merger of its Saur unit and Saint-Gobains' Cise unit would have a positive impact on Bouygues' earnings per share for 1997.</p>
</text>
